WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.207 --> 00:00:11.214
In this guide we invite a teammate to the workspace. Open the members page, enter an email address and choose a role. The invitation is sent right away.

2
00:00:11.907 --> 00:00:16.629
On the Members page, click Invite member in the top-right corner.

3
00:00:16.749 --> 00:00:21.192
A dialog opens with two fields: the email address and the role.

4
00:00:21.312 --> 00:00:23.340
Type the teammate's email address.

5
00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:27.856
Then pick a role. Members can edit, viewers can only read.

6
00:00:27.976 --> 00:00:29.400
We choose Member.

7
00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:31.455
Click Send invitation.

8
00:00:31.575 --> 00:00:36.046
The teammate appears in the list as pending, and an email is on its way.

9
00:00:36.249 --> 00:00:42.973
The invitation stays pending until the teammate accepts it. You can resend or revoke it from the same list.
